9. The latest successful backend CI run at the audit HEAD executed 342 selected tests. That is valid evidence for that selected suite only—not whole-backend or production acceptance.
10. Production database/deployment, live external integrations, load behavior and recovery drills were not directly tested during this repository-level audit.

These are integration/readiness findings—not a claim every capability is completely absent. Inspect source and contracts again before classifying any proposed path as truly missing.

